 "honest_boundary": [
  "The model is finite-dimensional and pointwise: E plays the role of a tangent space, and the metric and scalar curvature are abstract data; no manifold, path space or Ricci-flow PDE is constructed.",
  "The general L-minimiser existence and the Jacobian comparison are state-only Props; only the finite-dimensional Gaussian model proves minimiser existence.",
